.aider*
node_modules/

# Environment variables — NEVER commit these
.env

# Reddit Scout — local state and secrets
scripts/.scout-env
scripts/.scout-seen.json
scripts/reddit-scout.log

# Forgenta Backup Sync — local state and logs
scripts/backup-drive-sync.log
scripts/backup-sync.log
scripts/graph-sync.log

# Local pre-edit snapshots. Untracked from the repo 2026-07-18: the archives are
# large (~18 MB of zips alone), regenerable, and one contained a copy of the real
# financial fixture that is itself gitignored below. Backups stay on disk and
# mirror to Drive via scripts/backup-drive-sync.ps1 — they never belong in git.
#
# THE GLOB IS WIDER THAN THE PATH ON PURPOSE. `backups/` matches one exact name,
# and the backup path is built by shell interpolation — so a mis-quoted command
# writes somewhere `backups/` does not cover and the archive lands outside the
# only rule protecting it. That is not hypothetical: a directory literally named
# `backups$(date +%Y-%m-%d_%H%M%S)` was sitting in this working tree on
# 2026-08-09, untracked AND unignored, one `git add -A` away from a PUBLIC repo.
# It happened to be empty, so git could never have taken it. The next one might
# not be, and this repo has already leaked a real financial fixture exactly once
# by letting a backup route around an ignore rule.
backups/
backups*/
.env.local
.env.*.local
.env.development
.env.production
.env.staging
.env.test

# Android keystore
forged.jks

# build output
dist/
.vercel

# Security/compliance docs — untracked from the public repo 2026-06-21,
# authoritative versioned copies now live in Google Drive (see
# reference_compliance_docs_drive memory)
docs/plaid-compliance-policies.md
docs/data-retention-policy.md

# Bi-daily security review reports — exploit-detail writeups, untracked from the
# public repo 2026-06-21, authoritative copies now live in Google Drive (see
# reference_compliance_docs_drive memory). Going forward, write future reports
# to security-reports/ locally only — never commit them.
security-reports/*.md

# Claude Code skills — local tooling, not project source, never needed on GitHub
.claude/skills/

# Claude Code personal settings/permission allowlist and planning notes — machine-specific,
# not shareable team config or project source
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/plan/

# Graphify knowledge graph — regenerable (`python -m graphify update .`), mirrors to the
# Obsidian vault separately (scripts/sync-graph-to-obsidian.ps1), not useful in git history
graphify-out/

# Python bytecode cache
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Forecast golden-test fixture — a snapshot of REAL personal financial data (balances, income,
# accounts) captured from the running app. This repo is PUBLIC, so the fixture is kept LOCAL
# ONLY; the Tier-A test self-skips when it is absent (see forecast-engine.goldenTierA.test.ts).
src/lib/__tests__/fixtures/forecast-inputs.real*.json


# Weekly marketing counts — real business figures (signups, subscribers, reach) typed in
# from free dashboards. This repo is PUBLIC, so the values stay local; the SCHEMA and a
# fully invented example are committed as marketing/metrics/counts.example.csv, which is
# what a fresh checkout needs to run marketing/scripts/marketing-report.mjs.
marketing/metrics/counts.csv
marketing/scripts/marketing-report.log

# Raw audience-research dumps: hundreds of real Reddit posts with usernames, permalinks and
# personal financial detail, pulled for analysis. This repo is PUBLIC, and republishing other
# people's posts here is not ours to do. The aggregate counts and the conclusions are committed
# as marketing/research/FINDINGS.md; re-run marketing/scripts/research/reddit-rss-pull.mjs for the corpus.
marketing/research/raw/

# One-off measurement probes. Both read absolute paths on this machine — probe-chunks
# compares dist/ against a scratch clone at C:/Users/tvonh/Desktop/gf-before — so they
# do not run anywhere else and would be dead weight in a fresh checkout. The tools that
# survived the session and DO run from the repo root are committed:
# scripts/measure-bundle-delta.mjs and scripts/capture-motion-evidence.mjs.
scripts/probe-*.mjs

# Playwright's own per-page trace videos, named page@<hash>.webm. Every evidence run
# drops one per context, ~900 kB each, and they are duplicates of the named before/
# after clips that are committed alongside them. The named clips are the evidence; these
# are the raw tape. Ten of them was 9 MB on one afternoon's capture.
handoff/evidence/**/page@*.webm

# Raw Supabase row dump for the offline fixture recapture harness. REAL financial data.
src/lib/__tests__/fixtures/raw-rows.real*.json

# single-instance lock for scripts/sync-graph-to-obsidian.ps1
scripts/.graph-sync.lock
